on":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105755","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105755","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105755.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105755.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/62418.\r\n\r\nThe following editor operations will now warn the user if the available space on the target disk is low:\r\n\r\n- Saving a scene (< 1 GiB).\r\n- Importing a set of resources (< 2 GiB).\r\n- Downloading an export template (< 1 GiB, checked per-file).\r\n- Installing export templates from a TPZ (< 4 GiB).\r\n- Exporting a project (< 10 GiB).\r\n- Packing a project as a ZIP file (< 10 GiB).\r\n\r\nThe existing MovieWriter disk space check now makes use of the newly added method for consistency.\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95111.\r\n- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/45354\r\nand https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105742.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105755/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105755/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}